1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,220
Now,what about the computers?
现在，电脑怎么样？

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:06,210
I think it might be a good idea to install some new models.
我想装一些新型号是一个好主意。

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:12,110
They would take up a lot less room and so that would increase the work space for text books and so on.
它们占用的空间少，这样可以增加参考书等资源的运行空间。

4
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:15,400
That would be great.It is a bit cramped in there at times.
太好了。有时里面的地方是很小。

5
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:17,850
What about other resources?
其他资源怎么样？

6
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:21,300
Do you have a list of things that the students would like to see improved?
你有学生们希望改进的单子目录吗？

7
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:29,450
Yes,one of the comments that students frequently make is that they find it difficult to find materials that are appropriate for their level,
是的。学生们经常说难以找到适合自己水平的材料，

8
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:34,270
especially reading resources,so I think we need to label them more clearly.
特别是读书资源，所以我想我们需要把它们标记得更清楚一些。

9
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:38,220
Well that's easy enough,we can get that organised very quickly.
这很简单，我们可以很快弄好。

10
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:44,450
In fact I think we should review all of the study resources as some of them are looking a bit out-of-date.
事实上，我觉得我们应该检查一下所有的学习资源，因为有些资源已经有点过时了。

11
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:49,070
Definitely.The CD section especially needs to be more current.
当然。特别是光盘区需要更新。

12
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:55,960
I think we should get some of the ones that go with our latest course books and also make multiple copies.
我认为我们应该引进一些与最新课本配套的资源，并且多留一些副本。
